        <div id="matrix_959682" class="sortable-matrix" data-matrixId="959682"><div class="n module-type-header diyfeLiveArea "> <h1><span class="diyfeDecoration">Frequently Asked Questions</span></h1> </div><div class="n module-type-text diyfeLiveArea "> <p style="margin-bottom: 0cm;"> </p>
<p style="margin-bottom: 0cm;"><span style="font-size:28px;"><strong>How do I Book?</strong></span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"> </p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;">Orders can be taken via the online <a href="https://www.highflyersukcouriers.com/bookings/" target="_self">BOOKINGS</a></span> form or by phoning 07887781089,
07760242729</p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;">or 07763128410.</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"> </p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;">Orders are taken from 10am Thursdays through to Mondays at 4pm.</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"> </p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;">We are open over weekends to take bookings, Saturdays 10am – 4pm and Sundays 10am – 4pm. Orders taken during this time are for
collection/delivery that week.</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"> </p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;">The deadline cut off for orders each week is Monday at 4pm, any orders booked after this time will not be processed and will go into the
following week.</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;">Please note phone orders will not be taken on a Tuesday or Wednesday.</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"> </p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;">To book we need complete full addresses for both collection and delivery, including contact telephone numbers for each address, the type
of bird/animal, the quantity and who is paying for carriage. You may request a carrier box subject to availability. (We provide boxes for all pigeons).</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"> </p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;">Please note we do not accept payments online or over the phone, carriage can be paid at the door in cash or via the bank if requested and
if applicable.</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"> </p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;">Please note: We can no longer take orders via text, Facebook or voicemail.</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"> </p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><strong><span style="font-size:22.0pt;">When will my collection/delivery take place?</span></strong></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"> </p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;">We do collections and deliveries every week. We operate on a next day service basis.</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;">Our pickup and delivery days are Tuesdays-Fridays and work as follows:</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"> </p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;">If you have a <strong>collection</strong> from London or the South Coast regions, we aim to collect these on a Tuesday and deliver on a
Wednesday.</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"> </p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;">If you have a <strong>delivery</strong> going <strong>into</strong> London, we aim to collect these on a Thursday and deliver on
Friday.</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"> </p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;">All other areas are collected on a Wednesday and delivered on a Thursday.</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"> </p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;">Aberdeen and Inverness are not weekly, please speak to the office before making a booking for these areas.</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"> </p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;">These delivery days may be subject to change during peak season and busy periods. We will contact you directly if there are any changes
to your job.</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"> </p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;">*Please note that in the rare event your birds have been collected and are unable to be delivered next day due to unforeseen
circumstances such as a driver breakdown, we are able to keep the birds in our holding area pens and they will be fed on corn and water and cared for by pigeon fanciers.</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"> </p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><strong><span style="font-size:22.0pt;">When will I get a time slot?</span></strong></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"> </p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;">We will always call you the day <u>before</u> a collection or delivery takes place.</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;">You will receive a call with a 2-hour time slot.</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"> </p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;">If you cannot answer the phone, we will always leave a voice message or text message asking you to confirm receipt of this, if you for
whatever reason don’t reply, we can’t always guarantee your booking as we would not send a driver to an address if unsure if a customer is going to be there.</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"> </p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;">(We cannot give you an immediate timeslot when you make a booking as all jobs are entered into our system on Monday at 4pm when orders
are closed which generates the times for the jobs in your area.)</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"> </p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;">Please be assured that we will call you the day before, please do not call us asking for your time before your allotted
collection/delivery day. We have a large volume of customers to contact and by calling us to ask, this can delay us.</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"> </p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><strong><span style="font-size:22.0pt;">What if I am not available on the day?</span></strong></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"> </p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;">You will need to make sure you are available on the day for your collection or delivery.</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"> </p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;">The only alternatives are to rebook for the following week, or you can discuss with the office during your timeslot telephone call other
arrangements within reason.</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;">Such as, leaving with a neighbour, in a loft/shed or you can request a 30-minute call from the driver if you are at work to give you time
to get back for example.</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"> </p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;">This is why we strongly advise you answer the call for your time slot confirmation in case any issues arise.</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"> </p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><strong><span style="font-size:22.0pt;">How do I pay?</span></strong></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"> </p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;">We do not accept payments online or over the phone. Payment can be made at the door in cash on collection or delivery (please state which
end is paying upon on booking).</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;">We accept payment via bank transfer and details can be given on request.</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;">Some jobs we may ask for a deposit to secure a slot, in this case will we contact you directly.</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"> </p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><strong><span style="font-size:22.0pt;">How much does it cost?</span></strong></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0cm;"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;">Prices vary depending on the areas and what is being transported.</span></p>
