<p> </p>
<p><span style="font-size:14.0pt;">We are open 365* days of the year!</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size:14.0pt;"><span style="font-size:14px;">*Excluding Christmas Day and Boxing Day.</span></span></p>
<p><span style="font-size:14.0pt;">We pick up and deliver each week*</span></p>
